    "体重偏轻时，公式估算的消耗可能偏低。如果两周的平均体重还在下降，每天多吃 200～300 千卡，或咨询医生、营养师。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you're underweight, the formula may underestimate your energy needs. If your two-week average weight keeps dropping, eat 200–300 kcal more a day, or talk to a doctor or dietitian."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体重偏轻时，公式估算的消耗可能偏低。如果两周的平均体重还在下降，每天多吃 200～300 千卡，或咨询医生、营养师。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体重基数较大时，配合力量训练、按维持热量吃也能长肌肉，同时不额外增加体脂。可以考虑选择「维持」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At a higher body weight, you can build muscle while eating at maintenance with strength training, without adding extra fat. Consider choosing Maintain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体重基数较大时，配合力量训练、按维持热量吃也能长肌肉，同时不额外增加体脂。可以考虑选择「维持」。"
          }
        }
      }
