    },
    "你填写的过敏食材和忌口会用于食谱推荐，推荐会尽量避开这些食材和用它们做的食品。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The allergies and foods to avoid you enter are used for recipe suggestions, which try to leave out these ingredients and foods made from them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你填写的过敏食材和忌口会用于食谱推荐，推荐会尽量避开这些食材和用它们做的食品。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你现在的目标是？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What's Your Goal?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你现在的目标是？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的 BMI 约为 %@，低于 %@，属于偏轻范围，所以这里不提供减脂目标。可以选择「维持」或「增肌」；如果对体重有顾虑，建议咨询医生或营养师。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your BMI is about %1$@, below %2$@, which is in the underweight range, so a fat-loss target isn't offered. You can choose Maintain or Build Muscle. If you have concerns about your weight, consider talking to a doctor or dietitian."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 BMI 约为 %@，低于 %@，属于偏轻范围，所以这里不提供减脂目标。可以选择「维持」或「增肌」；如果对体重有顾虑，建议咨询医生或营养师。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的基本信息" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
