    "拍照识别、AI 估算食物、生成食谱和推荐下一餐，是由 Anthropic 公司的 Claude AI 完成的。使用前，请先看看会发送哪些内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photo scanning, AI food estimates, recipe generation and next-meal suggestions are powered by Claude, an AI from Anthropic. Before you use them, here's what gets sent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拍照识别、AI 估算食物、生成食谱和推荐下一餐，是由 Anthropic 公司的 Claude AI 完成的。使用前，请先看看会发送哪些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拍照识别、生成食谱和推荐下一餐会用到 AI。关闭后，用到 AI 前会先问你；手动记录不受影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photo analysis, recipes and next-meal suggestions use AI. When this is off, you'll be asked before AI is used. Manual logging isn't affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拍照识别、生成食谱和推荐下一餐会用到 AI。关闭后，用到 AI 前会先问你；手动记录不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
