        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Daily targets are formula-based estimates, not medical advice. This app is for adults 18 and older. If you have a health condition (especially kidney disease or diabetes), are pregnant or breastfeeding, or have a history of eating disorders, please talk to a doctor or registered dietitian first."
